<title>USA: Claremont completes OpTex acquisition.</title>
<headline>Claremont completes OpTex acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Claremont Technology Group Inc,  a computer systems integrator, on Monday said it completed the acquisition of OpTex Inc.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>OpTex, based in Dublin, Ohio, is a privately held developer of billing and customer-management software for the communications industry. It has about 40 employees.</p>
